{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 48, :comments ["<b>And he shall make a Passover.</b> One might think every convert must make a Passover immediately — Scripture teaches <b>והיה כאזרח הארץ</b>: just as a native-born does it on the fourteenth, so too a convert on the fourteenth (ibid.)." "<b>And every uncircumcised person shall not eat of it.</b> To include one whose brother died because of circumcision — for he is not an apostate to uncircumcision, and we do not learn him from ״בֶּן נֵכָר לֹא יֹאכַל בּוֹ״ (ibid.)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:53.636509396Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}